-- src:146 | (c) in the case of a company that is to be a public company, the person who is (or the persons who are) to be the first secretary (or joint secretaries) of the company.
@ref s 12(1) Statement of proposed officers: the required information about the first officers (src:142-146)
GIVEN `the statement contains the required information about the person or persons to be the first director or directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is to be a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person is to be the first secretary (or persons are to be joint secretaries)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement contains the required information about the first secretary (or joint secretaries)` IS A BOOLEAN
